  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Crockett Park sits on gently rolling hills in a beautiful Brentwood city park, mixing open ground with wooded stretches across 4,840 feet at par 56. It's the kind of course that rewards clean play without demanding huge distance.",
    "Free to play with mixed tees and Chainstar baskets, and both tee positions play par 56 — so you can step up or back without changing the math. The variety of open and wooded holes keeps the round interesting from start to finish.",
    "A friendly, well-kept park course that's perfect for a weekday round or introducing someone to the sport."
  ],
