  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 9 is the longest at Crockett at 429 feet — a par 4 that rolls with the park's gentle hills and gives the round its one true two-shot moment. From the tee it's a placed drive across the open ground; from there, a clean approach to a basket the scenery frames. It's the hole that makes the front nine memorable.",
